{"state":"okay","message":"정상적으로 데이터를 가져왔습니다.","payload":[{"WordDictionary":"<div class=\"top_txt\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; clear: both; overflow: hidden; height: 20px; vertical-align: top; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 20px !important; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><p class=\"s_tit\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(1, 1, 1); font-weight: bold; float: left; font-size: 14px !important; font-family: &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">해상도 [디지털 액자]</p></div><p align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><img border=\"0\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://img.danawa.com/images/termDicImages/1/10/9456_1_1372651666.jpg\" width=\"340\" height=\"160\" style=\"border: 0px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 20px !important; height: auto !important;\"></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">&nbsp;</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">▲낮은해상도(좌), 높은해상도(우)</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><br style=\"line-height: 20px !important;\">해상도란 화면에 보여지는 이미지의 정밀도를 가로 X 세로의 화소 수로 표현한 것입니다. 640 x 480, 1024 x 768 등이 모두 해상도를 나타내는 것으로써, 앞의 숫자가 가로 화소수, 뒤의 숫자가 세로 화소수를 말합니다.</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><img id=\"image_015184772394627344\" class=\"chimg_photo\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://img.danawa.com/images/termDicImages/1/10/9456_1_1372651667.png\" style=\"border: 0px; vertical-align: top; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; height: 177px; max-width: 100%; width: 335px; line-height: 20px !important; text-align: center !important;\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">&nbsp;</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">&nbsp;&lt; 해상도 640 x 480의 예시 &gt;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><br style=\"line-height: 20px !important;\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\">해상도가 높을수록 한 화면에서 표시할 수 있는 양이 늘어나 이미지 품질이 좋아지지만 가격도 그만큼 올라가게 됩니다.</p><p style=\"line-height: 20px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: -0.2px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\"><br style=\"line-height: 20px !important;\"></p>"}]}